        {
          "text": "This book is not dedicated to a person."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 47
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is dedicated to those who think deeply but speak rarely."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To those who feel everything but explain nothing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 49
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To those who carry entire worlds inside their mind…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and still continue to observe them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 51
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And to the version of you that didn’t stop reading even when nothing was promised…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 52
